{"id":"honestidad","lemma":"honestidad","pos":"noun","rank":3794,"glosses":["honesty"],"ipa":"/onestiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"honestidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-honestidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Gracias por tu honestidad.","en":"Thank you for your honesty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594883","words":[{"g":"thank you, thanks"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Nunca cuestionaría su honestidad.","en":"I would never question his honesty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687307","words":[{"g":"never"},null,{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"La honestidad no siempre paga.","en":"Honesty doesn't always pay.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804363","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"payment"}]},{"text":"La honestidad no es siempre la mejor política.","en":"Honesty is not always the best policy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610962","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"better"},{"g":"politics"}]},{"text":"Ella lo elogió por su honestidad.","en":"She praised him for his honesty.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}